   "lines": [
    "Took a long tramp",
    "with Jack[?] Tebbetts[?],",
    "who has improved",
    "wonderfully; I like",
    "him very much",
    "indeed.",
    "Have just received",
    "a letter telling me",
    "that Cornelius has",
    "distinguished him",
    "-self by marrying",
    "a french actress!",
    "He is a disgrace",
    "to the family -",
    "the vulgar brute."
   ],
